62
00:02:24,040 --> 00:02:29,540
EPISODE 45:
TEARS AT THE AIRPORT

63
00:02:24,260 --> 00:02:27,460
Furano continues its fierce attacks on Nankatsu's goal!

64
00:02:27,460 --> 00:02:30,460
What will Furano do to score a goal?

65
00:02:30,460 --> 00:02:32,380
Wakamatsu-kun sprints forward.

66
00:02:33,960 --> 00:02:35,710
Will he take a shot?

67
00:02:36,660 --> 00:02:39,050
No, Nankatsu blocked him!

68
00:02:39,050 --> 00:02:41,390
They won't let him reach the goal.

69
00:02:41,390 --> 00:02:43,610
Good, everyone!

70
00:02:43,610 --> 00:02:46,600
Nankatsu was previously called "Tsubasa's one-man team",

71
00:02:46,600 --> 00:02:49,770
but that's really not true.

72
00:02:49,770 --> 00:02:52,920
Even though he can't use his full strength as he normally would right now,

73
00:02:52,920 --> 00:02:58,110
the team compensates for it, helping each other, and putting on a great performance.

74
00:02:58,690 --> 00:03:04,620
And as their captain, Tsubasa suppresses his pain under these conditions and does his best.

75
00:02:58,690 --> 00:03:01,970
Iwami, one-two! Then pass to Nagano!

76
00:03:05,310 --> 00:03:06,650
I can say it clearly.

77
00:03:06,650 --> 00:03:09,870
Nankatsu is the best team in Japan.

78
00:03:09,870 --> 00:03:12,680
Furano steals the ball once again!

79
00:03:12,680 --> 00:03:13,580
Nice steal!

80
00:03:13,580 --> 00:03:17,090
Proof of their determination to score a goal and tie the game.

81
00:03:17,090 --> 00:03:18,680
You can do it! Keep fighting!

82
00:03:18,680 --> 00:03:20,400
Good luck, everyone.

83
00:03:20,400 --> 00:03:24,960
We're a team from the northern lands; often, they said we were powerless

84
00:03:24,960 --> 00:03:27,560
against the heat, or had no place in the race.

85
00:03:27,560 --> 00:03:29,020
But... look at this.

86
00:03:29,020 --> 00:03:33,770
Despite the heat, we've won throughout the tournament day after day.

87
00:03:33,770 --> 00:03:37,070
Just look! They've chased the champion Nankatsu this far!

88
00:03:37,070 --> 00:03:38,570
Alright! Let's go!

89
00:03:38,570 --> 00:03:40,190
We'll definitely get a chance!

90
00:03:40,190 --> 00:03:41,950
Don't give up, keep attacking!

91
00:03:41,950 --> 00:03:44,830
No other player but Matsuyama can compete...

92
00:03:44,830 --> 00:03:46,950
But they can do it if they try.

93
00:03:46,950 --> 00:03:50,020
I want you to win.

94
00:03:50,020 --> 00:03:50,580
Take this!

95
00:03:50,950 --> 00:03:52,600
Furano shoots the ball toward the goal!

96
00:03:52,600 --> 00:03:53,290
Okay!

97
00:03:54,290 --> 00:03:55,710
Morisaki clears it!

98
00:03:55,710 --> 00:03:57,550
Furano couldn't score again!

99
00:03:57,550 --> 00:03:58,810
Alright, here we go!

100
00:03:58,810 --> 00:04:00,260
We'll attack this time!

101
00:04:00,260 --> 00:04:01,010
Okay!

102
00:04:01,010 --> 00:04:04,840
Nankatsu finally gets a chance to make an attack after a long time!

103
00:04:04,840 --> 00:04:06,010
Get back, everyone!

104
00:04:06,010 --> 00:04:07,760
We have to get back immediately!

105
00:04:07,760 --> 00:04:09,810
Nankatsu is attacking...

106
00:04:09,810 --> 00:04:13,190
If they score one more now, the game ends here.

107
00:04:13,190 --> 00:04:16,270
Who will Izawa pass to?

108
00:04:16,270 --> 00:04:17,900
Eat this!

109
00:04:17,900 --> 00:04:20,490
Ahh, Izawa-kun shoots directly!

110
00:04:20,490 --> 00:04:21,780
As if I'd let you!

111
00:04:22,490 --> 00:04:24,810
Goalkeeper Kato-kun reacts in time!

112
00:04:24,810 --> 00:04:26,950
But the ball fell right in front of Taki-kun.

113
00:04:28,950 --> 00:04:30,700
This goal will finish the job!

114
00:04:32,920 --> 00:04:34,620
Furano blocked this too!

115
00:04:34,620 --> 00:04:35,750
Everyone!

116
00:04:35,750 --> 00:04:38,250
Now the ball drops in front of the goal!

117
00:04:38,250 --> 00:04:39,960
I'll handle it!

118
00:04:39,960 --> 00:04:42,300
A sliding shot from Kisugi!

119
00:04:42,300 --> 00:04:43,640
But no, it won't go in!

120
00:04:43,640 --> 00:04:44,550
Furano deflects it!

121
00:04:44,550 --> 00:04:48,010
Matsuyama-kun stopped marking Tsubasa-kun for this perfect move!

122
00:04:48,010 --> 00:04:48,720
Ah!

123
00:04:48,720 --> 00:04:51,970
But the cleared ball falls right in front of Tsubasa-kun!

124
00:04:51,970 --> 00:04:52,730
Damn it!

125
00:04:55,980 --> 00:04:57,100
Drive...

126
00:04:55,980 --> 00:05:01,190
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

127
00:04:59,910 --> 00:05:01,190
Shot!

128
00:05:08,070 --> 00:05:10,530
Matsuyama-kun blocks with his whole body!

129
00:05:10,530 --> 00:05:12,450
But it's really powerful!

130
00:05:12,450 --> 00:05:14,410
It's heading straight for the goal!

131
00:05:14,410 --> 00:05:15,460
Matsuyama-kun!

132
00:05:15,460 --> 00:05:16,750
Captain!

133
00:05:17,550 --> 00:05:22,050
Everyone in front of the goal came to support Matsuyama-kun!

134
00:05:22,560 --> 00:05:23,510
Matsuyama-kun!

135
00:05:23,510 --> 00:05:26,380
The Drive Shot has been stopped!

136
00:05:23,510 --> 00:05:26,380
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

137
00:05:30,290 --> 00:05:31,190
Everyone...

138
00:05:31,190 --> 00:05:32,450
Captain...

139
00:05:32,450 --> 00:05:37,190
The Furano eleven united as one and blocked Tsubasa-kun's Drive Shot!

140
00:05:32,450 --> 00:05:37,190
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

141
00:05:37,190 --> 00:05:38,360
You did it!

142
00:05:38,360 --> 00:05:41,690
Did you see? This is Furano's true teamwork!

143
00:05:41,690 --> 00:05:42,540
Damn it...

144
00:05:42,540 --> 00:05:46,900
Tsubasa put all his strength into that Drive Shot, and yet...

145
00:05:42,540 --> 00:05:46,900
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

146
00:05:46,900 --> 00:05:48,280
Tsubasa-kun...

147
00:05:48,280 --> 00:05:49,790
Damn it, Tsubasa...

148
00:05:49,790 --> 00:05:53,790
Even though it strains his body the most, he had to use the Drive Shot...

149
00:05:49,790 --> 00:05:53,790
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

150
00:05:53,790 --> 00:05:56,050
Everyone! We can't afford to slow down!

151
00:05:56,050 --> 00:05:56,970
We don't have time!

152
00:05:56,970 --> 00:05:57,920
Let's attack now!

153
00:05:57,920 --> 00:06:00,340
It's our turn to score now!

154
00:06:00,340 --> 00:06:01,040
Yes!

155
00:06:01,040 --> 00:06:03,880
Another Avalanche Attack from Furano!

156
00:06:03,880 --> 00:06:07,260
In the remaining time, this may be the final attack.

157
00:06:07,260 --> 00:06:12,420
Regardless of my move to the US...
I just want to see them win!

158
00:06:12,420 --> 00:06:14,860
Matsuyama-kun and everyone worked so hard to get here.

159
00:06:14,860 --> 00:06:16,270
I want them to win!

160
00:06:16,270 --> 00:06:17,810
Damn it!

161
00:06:19,730 --> 00:06:22,270
Tsubasa, this is the final showdown!

162
00:06:22,270 --> 00:06:23,730
I will definitely get through!

163
00:06:23,730 --> 00:06:25,280
I... won't lose!

164
00:06:25,280 --> 00:06:25,990
I... won't lose!

165
00:06:26,990 --> 00:06:29,260
Very little time left!

166
00:06:29,260 --> 00:06:32,490
It's fiercely Number 10 versus Number 10 once again!

167
00:06:36,750 --> 00:06:38,500
Good luck, Tsubasa!

168
00:06:38,500 --> 00:06:40,250
Get past him, Matsuyama!

169
00:06:40,250 --> 00:06:42,500
Matsuyama!

170
00:06:42,500 --> 00:06:51,260
Tsubasa!

171
00:06:42,990 --> 00:06:46,490
The stadium is filled with cheers for Matsuyama-kun and Tsubasa-kun!

172
00:06:46,490 --> 00:06:49,310
Who will emerge victorious in the end?

173
00:06:49,310 --> 00:06:51,260
Neither side is gaining ground!

174
00:07:01,060 --> 00:07:02,640
I won't let you take the ball from me!

175
00:07:02,640 --> 00:07:04,400
I'll use my control to get past you!

176
00:07:04,400 --> 00:07:05,900
As if I'd let you pass!

177
00:07:05,900 --> 00:07:07,350
Captain...

178
00:07:07,350 --> 00:07:08,970
Let's believe in our captain.

179
00:07:08,970 --> 00:07:10,910
We have to get in front of the goal!

180
00:07:10,910 --> 00:07:12,990
Tsubasa is near his limit.

181
00:07:12,990 --> 00:07:14,650
We have to help!

182
00:07:14,650 --> 00:07:15,410
Yes!

183
00:07:15,410 --> 00:07:18,410
Nankatsu will support Tsubasa-kun!

184
00:07:18,410 --> 00:07:22,710
If Furano loses the ball now, they have no one behind except the goalkeeper.

185
00:07:24,630 --> 00:07:26,960
If I say I'll pass, it means I will pass!

186
00:07:28,150 --> 00:07:30,630
The two clashed fiercely!

187
00:07:31,720 --> 00:07:32,970
Tsubasa-kun!

188
00:07:32,970 --> 00:07:35,580
But it's not a foul!

189
00:07:35,580 --> 00:07:37,200
Football is a physical sport!

190
00:07:37,200 --> 00:07:40,480
You can't always avoid a hit like that.

191
00:07:40,480 --> 00:07:41,430
Damn it!

192
00:07:41,430 --> 00:07:43,480
We have to stop you this time!

193
00:07:43,910 --> 00:07:44,980
Here I go!

194
00:07:46,980 --> 00:07:47,840
What?

195
00:07:47,840 --> 00:07:48,570
Damn it!

196
00:07:48,570 --> 00:07:50,800
He got past Kisugi-kun and Taki-kun!

197
00:07:50,800 --> 00:07:55,070
That's why they say he has the best control; Hikaru Matsuyama, the Wild Eagle of Hokkaido!

198
00:07:55,070 --> 00:07:56,620
We'll defend!

199
00:07:57,540 --> 00:08:00,160
Matsuyama-kun takes position to shoot.

200
00:08:00,160 --> 00:08:02,040
Will he unleash the North Country Shot?

201
00:08:02,040 --> 00:08:07,170
To pay you back for stopping Tsubasa's Drive Shot, we'll block your shot this time.

202
00:08:02,040 --> 00:08:07,170
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

203
00:08:07,170 --> 00:08:08,170
What?!

204
00:08:08,170 --> 00:08:10,720
Matsuyama-kun switched to a pass.

205
00:08:10,720 --> 00:08:13,030
He left the final shot to his friends!

206
00:08:13,030 --> 00:08:13,900
Let's go!

207
00:08:13,900 --> 00:08:16,260
We'll make sure the captain's pass reaches the goal!

208
00:08:16,260 --> 00:08:17,300
Damn it!

209
00:08:17,300 --> 00:08:21,720
We're bound by friendship and trust.

210
00:08:21,720 --> 00:08:23,020
I leave it to you, everyone!

211
00:08:27,150 --> 00:08:29,410
It's in!

212
00:08:29,410 --> 00:08:30,460
It's tied!

213
00:08:30,460 --> 00:08:32,700
Furano's persistence allowed us to witness their true potential!

214
00:08:34,200 --> 00:08:36,200
We did it, everyone!

215
00:08:36,200 --> 00:08:37,450
Captain!

216
00:08:37,450 --> 00:08:38,110
We did it!

217
00:08:38,110 --> 00:08:39,160
We caught up!

218
00:08:39,160 --> 00:08:40,200
It's tied!

219
00:08:40,200 --> 00:08:42,450
We did it, Yoshiko! The game is tied!

220
00:08:42,450 --> 00:08:44,330
I'm very happy, everyone!

221
00:08:45,010 --> 00:08:48,900
So you couldn't hold out until the end, Tsubasa...

222
00:08:48,900 --> 00:08:54,180
If you hadn't taken that Drive Shot there, you could have kept the one-goal lead.

223
00:08:48,900 --> 00:08:54,180
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

224
00:08:54,180 --> 00:08:58,970
But you chose to score... You chose to attack instead of defending what you had.

225
00:08:58,970 --> 00:09:01,360
Damn it! They caught up to us!

226
00:09:01,360 --> 00:09:03,250
We don't even have a minute left!

227
00:09:03,250 --> 00:09:04,600
Damn it!

228
00:09:07,140 --> 00:09:08,610
Tsubasa...

229
00:09:08,610 --> 00:09:11,520
The game isn't over yet, everyone.

230
00:09:12,860 --> 00:09:13,490
Tsubasa!

231
00:09:13,490 --> 00:09:14,490
Tsubasa!

232
00:09:14,490 --> 00:09:15,610
Tsubasa-kun!

233
00:09:16,050 --> 00:09:18,620
Less than a minute left.

234
00:09:18,620 --> 00:09:20,620
First and second half; 60 minutes.

235
00:09:20,620 --> 00:09:23,850
Tsubasa, I couldn't win against you.

236
00:09:23,850 --> 00:09:26,120
But I didn't lose either.

237
00:09:26,120 --> 00:09:28,120
Stand up, Tsubasa.

238
00:09:28,120 --> 00:09:30,120
I'll beat you in penalty kicks.

239
00:09:34,130 --> 00:09:36,380
Tsubasa stood up!

240
00:09:36,380 --> 00:09:39,810
He stood up holding his left shoulder.

241
00:09:39,810 --> 00:09:41,510
Are you okay, Tsubasa?

242
00:09:41,510 --> 00:09:43,040
Kisugi, Taki.

243
00:09:43,040 --> 00:09:45,640
When the game restarts, send me a pass immediately.

244
00:09:45,640 --> 00:09:47,480
What are you talking about, Tsubasa?

245
00:09:47,480 --> 00:09:48,710
In your current condition...

246
00:09:48,710 --> 00:09:49,600
He's right.

247
00:09:49,600 --> 00:09:51,280
It's impossible, even for you...

248
00:09:51,280 --> 00:09:53,030
Just send the ball to Tsubasa.

249
00:09:55,240 --> 00:09:58,690
Tsubasa, our captain, the captain of Nankatsu.

250
00:09:58,690 --> 00:10:01,160
We must follow our captain's orders to the end.

251
00:10:01,160 --> 00:10:03,200
Ishizaki...

252
00:10:08,240 --> 00:10:10,460
I trust you, Captain Tsubasa.

253
00:10:11,020 --> 00:10:12,590
Ishizaki-kun...

254
00:10:15,090 --> 00:10:17,740
Alright, we must follow our captain too.

255
00:10:17,740 --> 00:10:18,710
Yes.

256
00:10:21,090 --> 00:10:25,580
When he graduates from middle school, Tsubasa is going to Brazil.

257
00:10:25,580 --> 00:10:31,110
However, even if we lose today's match, I have no regrets about my middle school football life.

258
00:10:31,760 --> 00:10:36,860
Because I've been playing football with you all this time, Tsubasa.

259
00:10:41,740 --> 00:10:47,000
CERTAIN VICTORY

260
00:10:42,700 --> 00:10:44,240
Thank you, everyone.

261
00:10:44,240 --> 00:10:47,000
I'll bet everything on this final chance.

262
00:10:47,000 --> 00:10:51,500
Normally, he would have stayed forward and watched over us, even in this small time frame.

263
00:10:52,160 --> 00:10:55,000
Has your flame already died out, Tsubasa?

264
00:10:55,670 --> 00:10:56,920
The match continues.

265
00:10:57,460 --> 00:10:58,880
The ball is sent to Tsubasa-kun.

266
00:10:58,880 --> 00:11:00,240
Let's go!

267
00:11:01,010 --> 00:11:03,390
Tsubasa, are you still hanging on in this match...?

268
00:11:03,390 --> 00:11:06,770
Tsubasa takes position to shoot.

269
00:11:07,930 --> 00:11:11,890
My shoulder, my leg; let them break if they must!

270
00:11:11,890 --> 00:11:13,480
But... I'll take the shot!

271
00:11:15,480 --> 00:11:17,400
My Drive Shot...

272
00:11:15,480 --> 00:11:17,400
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

273
00:11:18,150 --> 00:11:21,910
Spread your wings to the wide sky!

274
00:11:23,490 --> 00:11:26,810
Tsubasa-kun took the shot from a very long distance.

275
00:11:26,810 --> 00:11:29,940
Matsuyama-kun jumped, but couldn't block it!

276
00:11:31,000 --> 00:11:33,400
The phoenix is flying!

277
00:11:37,340 --> 00:11:42,010
The ball traces a sharp line and continues its way toward Furano's goal.

278
00:11:44,270 --> 00:11:46,510
Nankatsu couldn't score!

279
00:11:46,510 --> 00:11:48,020
Damn it!

280
00:11:48,020 --> 00:11:51,730
The Drive Shot fell short of being a goal!

281
00:11:48,020 --> 00:11:51,730
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

282
00:11:54,980 --> 00:11:56,480
This...

283
00:11:58,900 --> 00:11:59,440
How?!

284
00:12:00,280 --> 00:12:05,530
The ball hit the ground, bounced, and pierced through the goal!

285
00:12:06,000 --> 00:12:08,540
The ball's spin is insane!

286
00:12:13,990 --> 00:12:15,340
It's in.

287
00:12:18,300 --> 00:12:23,300
~Anime Lovers~
Instagram: AnimeSeverlerrr

288
00:12:25,820 --> 00:12:28,970
3-2! What a shocking finale!

289
00:12:28,970 --> 00:12:31,930
Tsubasa's Drive Shot flew like a phoenix!

290
00:12:28,970 --> 00:12:31,930
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

291
00:12:31,930 --> 00:12:35,590
He refused to die until the very last minute!

292
00:12:35,590 --> 00:12:38,240
Nankatsu earns their place in tomorrow's final match!

293
00:12:38,240 --> 00:12:39,940
Tsubasa senpai is so cool!

294
00:12:39,940 --> 00:12:41,190
We did it!

295
00:12:41,190 --> 00:12:42,030
We won!

296
00:12:42,030 --> 00:12:43,820
We won, Tsubasa!

297
00:12:43,820 --> 00:12:46,340
The man who makes miracles happen!

298
00:12:46,340 --> 00:12:48,840
Within five seconds after the kick-off whistle,

299
00:12:48,840 --> 00:12:51,640
Tsubasa's Drive Shot carried them past Furano,

300
00:12:48,840 --> 00:12:51,640
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

301
00:12:51,640 --> 00:12:55,820
and they managed to secure a place in the finals for the third consecutive time!

302
00:12:55,820 --> 00:12:57,900
W-We won!

303
00:12:58,630 --> 00:12:59,540
Ah!

304
00:12:59,540 --> 00:13:00,300
Tsubasa!

305
00:13:02,720 --> 00:13:04,640
What's wrong, Tsubasa?

306
00:13:04,640 --> 00:13:07,110
We can't let a victor fall to the ground.

307
00:13:07,110 --> 00:13:08,430
Matsuyama-kun...

308
00:13:08,430 --> 00:13:10,160
Truly, Tsubasa...

309
00:13:10,160 --> 00:13:14,380
You're truly a man who won't give up on a fight until the very end.

310
00:13:14,380 --> 00:13:17,190
That last Drive Shot was proof of it.

311
00:13:14,380 --> 00:13:17,190
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

312
00:13:17,190 --> 00:13:21,480
Even after reaching the goal, it didn't die and bounced into the goal.

313
00:13:21,480 --> 00:13:23,950
Just like you.

314
00:13:25,820 --> 00:13:27,790
Now pull yourself together.

315
00:13:27,790 --> 00:13:31,370
You still have the final match tomorrow.

316
00:13:31,370 --> 00:13:33,620
Thank you, Matsuyama-kun.

317
00:13:36,180 --> 00:13:37,360
We lost...

318
00:13:37,360 --> 00:13:39,830
We lost in the final second!

319
00:13:39,830 --> 00:13:41,130
Damn it!

320
00:13:41,130 --> 00:13:42,400
Everyone...

321
00:13:43,290 --> 00:13:44,560
Stand up, everyone.

322
00:13:44,560 --> 00:13:48,260
We will thank the people in the stands who were with us one last time.

323
00:13:49,080 --> 00:13:50,220
Captain.

324
00:13:50,220 --> 00:13:54,220
Furano's players, who fought tenaciously but ultimately lost, will salute their fans.

325
00:13:54,980 --> 00:13:59,480
You truly fought very well until today, embodying warriors from the snowy lands.

326
00:13:59,480 --> 00:14:00,970
Everyone...

327
00:14:00,970 --> 00:14:02,320
Matsuyama-kun...

328
00:14:02,320 --> 00:14:04,420
Everyone, line up.

329
00:14:05,490 --> 00:14:08,070
Thank you very much for your support!

330
00:14:08,070 --> 00:14:09,830
Well done, Furano!

331
00:14:09,830 --> 00:14:13,810
Even though you were defeated, your teamwork is the best in Japan.

332
00:14:16,170 --> 00:14:21,590
Hikaru Matsuyama, despite your loss, you are a man among men!

333
00:14:22,530 --> 00:14:25,810
Our football is now over.

334
00:14:27,840 --> 00:14:30,710
Yoshiko, don't cry anymore.

335
00:14:30,710 --> 00:14:31,990
Yoshiko.

336
00:14:31,990 --> 00:14:33,260
Mom.

337
00:14:33,260 --> 00:14:35,520
They failed, didn't they?

338
00:14:35,520 --> 00:14:37,520
Yes.

339
00:14:38,240 --> 00:14:39,230
Oh!

340
00:14:41,950 --> 00:14:43,900
Matsuyama-kun's headband.

341
00:14:44,840 --> 00:14:46,400
Hey, Matsuyama!

342
00:14:46,400 --> 00:14:48,380
You forgot something.

343
00:14:48,380 --> 00:14:49,610
Ah, thank you.

344
00:14:50,210 --> 00:14:51,630
I'm grateful.

345
00:14:51,630 --> 00:14:54,280
Do your best and help Tsubasa tomorrow.

346
00:14:54,280 --> 00:14:55,470
Of course!

347
00:14:56,790 --> 00:15:01,410
The final will be between Nankatsu and Toho, just as we predicted.

348
00:15:01,410 --> 00:15:02,500
Yes.

349
00:15:03,720 --> 00:15:05,750
Tsubasa's Drive Shot...

350
00:15:03,720 --> 00:15:05,750
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

351
00:15:05,750 --> 00:15:11,140
I want to see the battle between him and Genzo as soon as possible on the Europe tour.

352
00:15:11,140 --> 00:15:14,450
In any case, we have to take you to my hospital.

353
00:15:14,450 --> 00:15:16,450
I want you to prepare the car.

354
00:15:16,450 --> 00:15:17,520
Yes, of course.

355
00:15:17,520 --> 00:15:18,900
God.

356
00:15:18,900 --> 00:15:21,020
Even though I warned you, you still went too far.

357
00:15:21,020 --> 00:15:25,490
If I hadn't gone that far, I wouldn't have won.

358
00:15:25,490 --> 00:15:27,280
I wanted to win.

359
00:15:27,280 --> 00:15:29,150
Tsubasa.

360
00:15:29,150 --> 00:15:31,790
But it's thanks to you, sensei.

361
00:15:31,790 --> 00:15:36,160
Thanks to your treatment and the words you wrote here.

362
00:15:36,160 --> 00:15:38,460
Did you write these words, sensei?

363
00:15:38,460 --> 00:15:39,610
Yes.

364
00:15:39,610 --> 00:15:43,350
I said my handwriting is really bad, but he still insisted I do it.

365
00:15:44,540 --> 00:15:45,790
FURANO MIDDLE SCHOOL
HOKKAIDO

366
00:15:47,210 --> 00:15:50,210
Our manager's headband was made with effort and embroidered...

367
00:15:50,910 --> 00:15:54,220
I'm sorry I couldn't win.

368
00:15:59,910 --> 00:16:01,480
This...

369
00:16:02,340 --> 00:16:04,300
She sewed this writing here and it's very small...

370
00:16:04,300 --> 00:16:08,230
And she even made sure it wouldn't be noticeable by embroidering it with white thread...

371
00:16:09,080 --> 00:16:10,570
Let me through!

372
00:16:11,030 --> 00:16:12,070
Fujisawa!

373
00:16:12,810 --> 00:16:19,660
Fujisawa Yoshiko-san will be moving to the US in the second term due to her father's work.

374
00:16:23,590 --> 00:16:25,170
Matsuyama-kun!

375
00:16:25,170 --> 00:16:26,380
Machida!

376
00:16:26,380 --> 00:16:27,450
Where did Fujisawa go?

377
00:16:27,450 --> 00:16:29,760
She left with her mother; they're getting into a taxi.

378
00:16:29,760 --> 00:16:30,520
What–

379
00:16:30,520 --> 00:16:33,760
Yoshiko is leaving for the US today.

380
00:16:33,760 --> 00:16:35,030
So where's their car?!

381
00:16:35,030 --> 00:16:38,220
Matsuyama-kun, Yoshiko had feelings...

382
00:16:38,220 --> 00:16:41,060
What's the matter? Do you need me?

383
00:16:41,060 --> 00:16:43,310
D-Do your best and win again today!

384
00:16:43,310 --> 00:16:45,630
Being a manager must be tough.

385
00:16:47,000 --> 00:16:48,960
Please make a copy of this.

386
00:16:48,960 --> 00:16:50,270
Okay.

387
00:16:50,270 --> 00:16:51,880
Come on, first-year!

388
00:16:51,880 --> 00:16:54,660
Don't let our manager polish all the balls by herself.

389
00:16:55,550 --> 00:16:57,050
Here, a towel.

390
00:16:57,050 --> 00:16:58,580
Furano, fight!

391
00:16:59,040 --> 00:17:00,580
Fujisawa...

392
00:17:05,540 --> 00:17:06,960
Is this the car?

393
00:17:06,960 --> 00:17:09,960
Yoshiko, wipe your tears now.

394
00:17:13,890 --> 00:17:15,090
Fujisawa!

395
00:17:27,450 --> 00:17:28,680
Fujisawa...

396
00:17:31,730 --> 00:17:33,050
Is that so?

397
00:17:33,050 --> 00:17:35,090
Fujisawa has already left.

398
00:17:35,090 --> 00:17:35,960
Yes.

399
00:17:35,960 --> 00:17:37,740
She sent her regards to everyone.

400
00:17:37,740 --> 00:17:42,070
If we had won, she would have stayed in Japan one more day...

401
00:17:42,070 --> 00:17:44,500
So, did the Captain go to see Fujisawa?

402
00:17:44,500 --> 00:17:48,830
He went after the taxi, but there's no way he can make it in time.

403
00:17:48,830 --> 00:17:50,250
Really?

404
00:17:50,250 --> 00:17:53,520
Actually, Yoshiko always had feelings for Matsuyama-kun...

405
00:17:53,520 --> 00:17:54,820
I'm not surprised.

406
00:17:55,300 --> 00:17:58,640
We actually always assumed it was like that.

407
00:17:58,640 --> 00:18:00,800
You could tell just by watching her.

408
00:18:00,800 --> 00:18:04,810
But our captain is quite thick-headed when it comes to these things.

409
00:18:04,810 --> 00:18:09,650
Then wait a second... Why did the Captain go after Fujisawa right now?

410
00:18:07,920 --> 00:18:10,690
TL Note: When did he change his clothes?!

411
00:18:09,650 --> 00:18:10,690
Now that you mention it...

412
00:18:10,690 --> 00:18:13,320
It'll be pointless if he doesn't make it.

413
00:18:13,320 --> 00:18:16,780
So Yoshiko will leave without confessing her feelings.

414
00:18:30,830 --> 00:18:32,090
Fujisawa!

415
00:18:32,090 --> 00:18:33,670
Matsuyama-kun.

416
00:18:40,390 --> 00:18:42,680
It looks like I made it.

417
00:18:42,680 --> 00:18:44,350
How?

418
00:18:44,350 --> 00:18:49,060
A man from the Football Federation gave me a ride after the taxi left.

419
00:18:49,060 --> 00:18:52,150
I asked him to drive as fast as he could.

420
00:18:52,150 --> 00:18:55,820
Forget catching up in time, we caught up and even passed you!

421
00:18:55,820 --> 00:18:57,900
Ah, Matsuyama-kun! You're injured!

422
00:18:57,900 --> 00:18:59,070
Huh?

423
00:19:01,530 --> 00:19:03,040
Ah, it's fine, really.

424
00:19:03,040 --> 00:19:04,310
But, your handkerchief...

425
00:19:04,310 --> 00:19:06,830
No! It's bleeding a lot...

426
00:19:07,840 --> 00:19:12,210
This will be the last time you treat my wounds like this.

427
00:19:12,210 --> 00:19:17,210
You always play recklessly, so you get injured a lot, Matsuyama-kun.

428
00:19:18,540 --> 00:19:20,950
I'd prefer you say "bravely."

429
00:19:20,950 --> 00:19:23,760
Here, press down on it a little with your hand.

430
00:19:23,760 --> 00:19:25,470
Thank you, Manager.

431
00:19:28,270 --> 00:19:30,020
What's wrong?

432
00:19:30,690 --> 00:19:35,020
Because you suddenly showed up here.

433
00:19:35,020 --> 00:19:36,200
What does this mean...?

434
00:19:36,200 --> 00:19:37,760
This is your fault.

435
00:19:37,760 --> 00:19:40,620
I yelled "Fujisawa!" and ran after the taxi,

436
00:19:40,620 --> 00:19:43,160
but you didn't notice and just went further away...

437
00:19:43,160 --> 00:19:45,910
That's when I hurt my knee too.

438
00:19:45,910 --> 00:19:46,880
Hey...

439
00:19:46,880 --> 00:19:47,910
Don't cry.

440
00:19:47,910 --> 00:19:49,290
But...

441
00:19:49,290 --> 00:19:51,040
I'm telling you not to cry.

442
00:19:51,040 --> 00:19:55,650
You can't even wipe your tears, your handkerchief is on my knee.

443
00:19:55,650 --> 00:19:56,590
Matsuyama-kun!

444
00:20:01,280 --> 00:20:03,300
Take care. Make sure you come back.

445
00:20:03,300 --> 00:20:04,090
Okay.

446
00:20:04,710 --> 00:20:06,790
Email me when you get there.

447
00:20:06,790 --> 00:20:08,770
I'll make sure to reply.

448
00:20:08,770 --> 00:20:09,520
Okay.

449
00:20:10,270 --> 00:20:16,600
Also, I'll keep this headband as a keepsake from you.

450
00:20:16,600 --> 00:20:17,740
Thank you.

451
00:20:18,360 --> 00:20:19,190
Okay.

452
00:20:27,330 --> 00:20:28,980
The captain is certainly taking his time...

453
00:20:28,980 --> 00:20:30,290
I wonder how far he went.

454
00:20:30,290 --> 00:20:32,800
Don't tell me he chased them all the way to the airport?!

455
00:20:32,800 --> 00:20:33,830
Yes, that's right.

456
00:20:33,830 --> 00:20:36,150
He doesn't have that much money on him, you know!

457
00:20:36,150 --> 00:20:37,200
Coach, sir.

458
00:20:37,200 --> 00:20:39,590
There's a phone call from young master Matsuyama-sama.

459
00:20:39,590 --> 00:20:40,040
Huh?

460
00:20:40,040 --> 00:20:41,300
Did you say Matsuyama?

461
00:20:42,090 --> 00:20:43,300
I'm very sorry, coach.

462
00:20:43,710 --> 00:20:46,050
I'm on my way back from Narita Airport.

463
00:20:46,050 --> 00:20:47,050
What?!

464
00:20:47,050 --> 00:20:51,330
I'll be dropped off directly at the lodging house, so please don't worry.

465
00:20:51,330 --> 00:20:52,930
Okay, understood.

466
00:20:53,560 --> 00:20:56,560
Good for you, Yoshiko?

467
00:20:58,610 --> 00:21:01,960
As I expected, the finals will be between Nankatsu and Toho.

468
00:21:01,960 --> 00:21:04,820
Finally, Kojiro Hyuga faces Tsubasa Ozora.

469
00:21:05,480 --> 00:21:07,840
However, Hyuga's situation bothers me.

470
00:21:07,840 --> 00:21:10,330
Will he play in tomorrow's final?

471
00:21:10,990 --> 00:21:14,640
To be honest, Hyuga's development after entering middle school

472
00:21:14,640 --> 00:21:17,500
was quite low compared to everyone's expectations.

473
00:21:18,130 --> 00:21:23,050
The kid who had nothing but an erratic fighting spirit in the elementary school tournament,

474
00:21:23,050 --> 00:21:27,510
fought alone against Nankatsu's Tsubasa, Misaki, and Wakabayashi... Kojiro Hyuga.

475
00:21:28,450 --> 00:21:34,940
After going to Toho Academy, his football style, reminiscent of a hungry beast, disappeared.

476
00:21:34,940 --> 00:21:39,070
From the bottom of my heart, I wish for the return of the Wild Tiger,

477
00:21:39,070 --> 00:21:40,940
for the sake of Japanese football.

478
00:21:41,390 --> 00:21:43,680
After Tsubasa goes to Brazil,

479
00:21:43,680 --> 00:21:47,200
the only one we can leave Japanese football to

480
00:21:47,200 --> 00:21:49,700
is you, Hyuga.

481
00:22:08,760 --> 00:22:12,270
Ah, coach, a letter arrived this morning.

482
00:22:12,270 --> 00:22:13,600
Ah, thank you.

483
00:22:16,310 --> 00:22:19,310
KOZO KIRA

484
